  "abstract": "<jats:title>Summary</jats:title>\n               <jats:p>Spearman's measure of disarray D is the sum of the absolute values of the difference between the ranks. We treat D as a metric on the set of permutations. The limiting mean, variance and normality are established. D is shown to be related to the metric I arising from Kendall's \u03c4 through the combinatorial inequality I \u2264 D \u2264 2I.</jats:p>",
